WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.883
Rex ran over to the dinosaur.

2
00:00:06.884 --> 00:00:10.464
"I can help you," Rex said.

3
00:00:10.465 --> 00:00:13.723
"Thanks!" the dinosaur said.

4
00:00:13.724 --> 00:00:16.836
"My name is Sid."

5
00:00:16.837 --> 00:00:25.251
Rex smiled. "I'm Rex."

6
00:00:25.252 --> 00:00:27.892
Rex looked at Sid's tail.

7
00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:31.121
The spike was stuck deep.

8
00:00:31.122 --> 00:00:35.450
"Cool tail!" Rex said.

9
00:00:35.451 --> 00:00:38.640
"How did it get stuck?"

10
00:00:38.641 --> 00:00:43.865
"I was swinging it," Sid said.

11
00:00:43.866 --> 00:00:47.011
"Why?" Rex asked.

12
00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:51.158
Sid shrugged. "It's fun.

13
00:00:51.159 --> 00:00:59.910
My tail can knock things over!"

14
00:00:59.911 --> 00:01:02.766
"Cool," Rex said.

15
00:01:02.767 --> 00:01:05.562
"I like to roar.

16
00:01:05.563 --> 00:01:08.463
Want to hear?"

17
00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:12.631
Sid nodded.

18
00:01:12.632 --> 00:01:15.489
"ROAR!"

19
00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:20.109
A branch shook and leaves fell.

20
00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:24.604
"Wow!" Sid said.

21
00:01:24.605 --> 00:01:26.911
"Can you help me now?"

22
00:01:26.912 --> 00:01:30.990
"Yes!" Rex said.

23
00:01:30.991 --> 00:01:33.571
He pulled on Sid's tail.

24
00:01:33.572 --> 00:01:37.894
It was still stuck.

25
00:01:37.895 --> 00:01:41.206
Rex pulled harder . . .

26
00:01:41.207 --> 00:01:45.322
And harder . . .

27
00:01:45.323 --> 00:01:49.769
Rex's claws slipped.

28
00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:51.732
He fell backward.

29
00:01:51.733 --> 00:01:53.109
Bam!

30
00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:57.047
"Ouch!" someone said.

